@startuml RoleManagementSequence

actor "用户" as User
participant "Vue3 Frontend" as Frontend
participant "Python Backend" as Backend
database "MySQL Database" as Database

== 角色列表 (Read) ==
User -> Frontend: 请求角色列表页面
Frontend -> Backend: GET /roles
activate Backend
Backend -> Database: SELECT * FROM roles
activate Database
Database --> Backend: 返回角色列表数据
deactivate Database
Backend --> Frontend: 返回角色列表数据
deactivate Backend
Frontend --> User: 显示角色列表

== 获取单个角色信息及权限 (Read One) ==
User -> Frontend: 选择一个角色，查看/编辑详情
Frontend -> Backend: GET /roles/{roleId}
activate Backend
Backend -> Database: SELECT * FROM roles WHERE id = {roleId}
activate Database
Database --> Backend: 返回角色数据
deactivate Database
Backend -> Database: SELECT menu_id FROM role_menu WHERE role_id = {roleId}
activate Database
Database --> Backend: 返回角色关联的菜单ID列表
deactivate Database
Backend --> Frontend: 返回角色数据和菜单ID列表
deactivate Backend
Frontend --> User: 显示角色详情及已分配权限

== 创建角色 (Create) ==
User -> Frontend: 点击“新建角色”，填写信息，选择菜单权限
Frontend -> Backend: POST /roles {name, intro, menuIds}
activate Backend
Backend -> Backend: 验证输入数据
Backend -> Database: INSERT INTO roles (name, intro) VALUES (...)
activate Database
Database --> Backend: 返回新角色ID
deactivate Database
opt 如果选择了菜单权限
    Backend -> Database: INSERT INTO role_menu (role_id, menu_id) VALUES (...) (批量或逐条)
    activate Database
    Database --> Backend: 插入成功
    deactivate Database
end
Backend --> Frontend: 返回创建成功响应
deactivate Backend
Frontend --> User: 显示创建成功消息，刷新列表

== 修改角色 (Update) ==
User -> Frontend: 修改角色信息或菜单权限，点击“保存”
Frontend -> Backend: PUT /roles/{roleId} {name, intro, menuIds}
activate Backend
Backend -> Backend: 验证输入数据
Backend -> Database: UPDATE roles SET name = ..., intro = ... WHERE id = {roleId}
activate Database
Database --> Backend: 更新成功
deactivate Database
Backend -> Database: DELETE FROM role_menu WHERE role_id = {roleId}
activate Database
Database --> Backend: 删除旧关联成功
deactivate Database
opt 如果选择了新的菜单权限
    Backend -> Database: INSERT INTO role_menu (role_id, menu_id) VALUES (...) (批量或逐条)
    activate Database
    Database --> Backend: 插入新关联成功
    deactivate Database
end
Backend --> Frontend: 返回更新成功响应
deactivate Backend
Frontend --> User: 显示修改成功消息，刷新列表/详情

== 删除角色 (Delete) ==
User -> Frontend: 选择一个角色，点击“删除”
Frontend -> Backend: DELETE /roles/{roleId}
activate Backend
Backend -> Backend: 验证删除权限
Backend -> Database: DELETE FROM role_menu WHERE role_id = {roleId}
activate Database
Database --> Backend: 删除关联成功
deactivate Database
Backend -> Database: DELETE FROM roles WHERE id = {roleId}
activate Database
Database --> Backend: 删除角色成功
deactivate Database
Backend --> Frontend: 返回删除成功响应
deactivate Backend
Frontend --> User: 显示删除成功消息，刷新列表

@enduml